{"type":"message","id":"aed1476b","parentId":"1f4bf003","timestamp":"2026-03-09T08:16:23.361Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_b1bccee3f5ff4ea687750666","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# USER.md - About Your Human\n\n- **Name:** Lorenc\n- **What to call them:** Lorenc\n- **Pronouns:** (optional)\n- **Timezone:** Europe/Berlin\n- **Location:** San Francisco\n- **Favorite Color:** Blue\n- **Favorite Programming Language:** TypeScript\n- **Hobbies:** Hiking on weekends\n- **Notes:** Likes getting things done without fluff. Personal assistant vibe.\n\n## Context\n\nLorenc wants an assistant who makes things happen—no unnecessary chatter, just helpful and competent.\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1773044183359}}
